LIE optionally links the system LZ4 C library when LIE_CHECKPOINT_COMPRESSION=ON
(default). LZ4 source is not vendored or copied into LIE. The upstream library is
BSD-2-Clause licensed; preserve the system package license when distributing it.
Upstream: https://github.com/lz4/lz4
License: https://github.com/lz4/lz4/blob/dev/lib/LICENSE
Local CPU validation used system liblz4 1.10.0. This notice is not a minimum
version promise; LIE uses compress_fast_extState, sizeofState and decompress_safe.
The generic retention and state framing implementation is independently written
MIT C17 code; no antirez/ds4 source was imported.
